<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Oil Search year net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Oil Search year net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    48.00 vs 39.29</p>
<p>    Net profit			    24.05 vs 22.84</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     0.99 vs 0.92</p>
<p>NOTE: Oil Search Ltd is a Papua New Guinea oil explorer and producer.  </p>
<p>    Sales				    80.16 vs 68.92</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		   loss 1.93 vs profit 0.97</p>
<p>    Tax					22.02 vs 15.77</p>
<p>    Extraordinary			    nil vs loss 1.64</p>
<p>    Earnings per shr (cents)	    5.25 vs 5.81</p>
<p>Dividend is unfranked</p>
<p>Pay date April 23</p>
<p>Reg date April 9</p>
<p>    Interest				   nil vs 1.75</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   17.29 vs 18.23</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
